    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65542" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μεγᾰρ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>citizen of Megara</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				23
			</span></i>, etc.: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μεγαρέες, -εῖς,
